<title>UK: John Lewis UK store sales up 11.3% y/y latest week.</title>
<headline>John Lewis UK store sales up 11.3% y/y latest week.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The John Lewis Partnership JLP.CN said its UK weekly department store sales rose 11.3 percent in the week to July 5 from the same week a year earlier.</p>
<p>In the 23 weeks to July 5, sales were up 10.1 percent.</p>
<p>Total sales, including the Waitrose supermarket group, rose 7.5 percent in the latest week and 7.0 percent in the 23 week period.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7708</p>
</text>
